  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Class preparation discovery guide"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Facilitator copy | 20 minute conversation | One recent experience"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Learn how an instructor prepared for one recent class. Use the participant’s account to locate a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Before the conversation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Prepare a quiet place, the agreed note storage location and a way to track time. Confirm who will see…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Note access and retention: _________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Facilitator and participant code: ____________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Opening words"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Thank you for talking with me. I would like to understand a recent class preparation experience. You…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Before we start, who may see the notes and how long they will be kept are written above. Is that…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Timing and route"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use 2 minutes for the opening, 7 for the recent task, 6 for follow-up questions and 5 for the closing.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Agreement to continue and take notes: _______________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Describe one recent task"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ask one question at a time. Let the participant finish before offering a probe. Follow the actual…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "1 Choose the occasion"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Think of the last class you prepared. What were you preparing? After the answer, ask: When did you start?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Occasion and context: _____________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "2 Walk through the sequence"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Please walk me through what you did, from starting preparation to feeling ready for class."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Optional probes: What happened next? What did you look at? Was anyone else involved? Ask for an example…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Sequence and materials: ___________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "3 Locate the decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "How did you decide that the preparation was ready to use?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision and information used: _____________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Follow the experience"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "These prompts explore the account without assuming that a problem occurred. Do not praise a particular…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "4 Explore effort"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Which part, if any, took more attention than you expected?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Optional probe: Can you describe a moment when that happened? Avoid asking why a tool was frustrating…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Example and participant wording: __________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "5 Explore what helped"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What, if anything, made the preparation easier?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What helped and when: ___________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "6 Compare with another occasion"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Was this preparation experience typical for you? What was different on another recent occasion?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Comparison and limits: ____________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Keep the notes distinct"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use a participant code rather than a name. A retrospective account belongs under Report. Use…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Observation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What I directly saw or heard during this conversation, with context:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Report"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What the participant said happened during the task. Use quotation marks only for exact words:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Inference"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "My possible explanation and a plausible alternative. Keep both separate from the account:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Unanswered questions and uncertain wording: __________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Close and decide what to examine next"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Check understanding"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Briefly repeat the sequence in your own words. Ask: What have I misunderstood or left out? Correct the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Participant corrections: ____________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Invite a final point"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Is there anything about preparing for that class that you wanted to mention but we did not cover?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Final point or intentionally skipped: _________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "End the conversation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Thank the participant. Restate the agreed note access and retention arrangement. Ask about later…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Facilitator debrief"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "After the participant leaves, identify one question for further investigation. Link it to a specific…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Question and note reference: ______________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Alternative explanation and next evidence: ___________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Owner and next review date: _______________________________________________"
    }
  ],
